{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Motivation\n\nThe Projects page currently shows a fixed `Status` kanban plus a home-grown table mode. It ignores the **saved views** people define on GitHub — layout, the field used for columns, grouping, sorting and the filter expression.\n\nGitHub exposes those definitions through GraphQL (`ProjectV2.views { name number layout filter groupByFields verticalGroupByFields sortByFields fields }`; `gh project` has no equivalent, so this is a `gh api graphql` call under the existing `project` scope requirement). vig should read them and render each layout **read-only**.\n\n## Plan (sub-issues)\n\n1. #149 Fetch saved views and switch between them (`v` / `V`), falling back to today's Status kanban when a project has no views or the fetch fails.\n2. #150 **Table layout** — visible fields in the view's column order, `sortByFields` as the initial sort, `groupByFields` as group header rows; the current `t` table mode is folded into this.\n3. #151 **Board layout** — columns from `verticalGroupByFields` (any single-select / iteration field, not only `Status`), `groupByFields` as horizontal swimlanes, `sortByFields` for the order inside a column.\n4. #152 **Roadmap layout** — a timeline over a date field or iteration start / end: items on the left, a month / week / day scale with span bars, a today marker and iteration bands on the right; zoom and horizontal scroll.\n5. #153 Evaluate the view's **filter expression** locally (`status:Todo -label:bug assignee:@me is:issue no:assignee` …) against the items already fetched — no extra API calls; unsupported tokens are warned about and ignored.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Read-only: grouping, sorting and filtering are computed locally; views are never created or edited.\n- Disk cache and stale re-fetch follow the existing board behaviour.\n- Add Board / Roadmap views (with an Iteration and a date field) to the demo project and update `tape/demo-projects.tape`.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABS-Axdw","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"All five sub-issues shipped: #149 (views fetch + v / V, PR #159), #150 (Table layout, PR #160), #151 (Board columns + swimlanes, PR #161), #152 (Roadmap, PR #165), #153 (filter expressions, PR #166). Saved views now drive the Projects page end to end.","createdAt":"2026-09-07T08:48:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/issues/148#issuecomment-5567951223","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:05:47Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":148,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: reproduce the project's saved views (Table / Board / Roadmap)"}
